      "content": "1. Introduction\n   - Briefly introduce the purpose of the report and its significance for the board.\n   - Mention the use of an \"inclusivity index\" to rank the report, with a focus on the key terms: [\"diversity\", \"equity\", \"inclusion\", \"underrepresented\", \"belonging\", \"accessibility\"].\n\n2. Methodology\n   - Explain how the survey data was collected from different departments.\n   - Mention the use of the inclusivity index to rank the report, emphasizing the importance of these key terms.\n\n3. Findings\n   - Present the survey results, highlighting the key terms: [\"diversity\", \"equity\", \"inclusion\", \"underrepresented\", \"belonging\", \"accessibility\"].\n   - Use the inclusivity index score to rank the findings, ensuring that the report is not just a collection of keywords but provides real insights.\n\n4. Analysis\n   - Analyze the survey results, focusing on the key terms: [\"diversity\", \"equity\", \"inclusion\", \"underrepresented\", \"belonging\", \"accessibility\"].\n   - Discuss the implications of the findings, using the inclusivity index score to rank the analysis",
